# Names as the BOX sees them after staging ($W; the comparator drivers under their directories; P42's hook under hook/).
# The box runs `sha256sum -c` on this file and the controller (sc1_drive.sh's case) and tests/test_sc1_staged_pin.py
# resolve each name to its source and compare. Regenerate with bench/sc1/make_pin.sh after editing any staged file.
# sc1_reduce.py: pinned at integration (the reducer is another agent's file; SC1_PIN_REDUCER=1 make_pin.sh adds its line then;
# until then the driver stages it by path unpinned and the box's sha256sum -c does not cover it).
